          Crafted with premium Oeko-Tex certified latex for a resilient, breathable support system that is naturally hypoallergenic. Features a lush moisture-wicking Tencel cover and airflow layers designed to maintain a perfectly cool sleep environment.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hand-crafted in the USA using traditional techniques and strictly non-toxic, chemical-free materials. Natural, organic cotton cover, GOLS certified latex, and premium wool moisture-wicking fire barrier.
        </p>
