            <h4>◎ Natural Latex</h4>
            <p>Premium Oeko-Tex certified latex for a resilient, breathable support system that is naturally hypoallergenic.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="posh-story__col">
            <h4>☁ Temperature Regulating</h4>
            <p>Moisture-wicking Tencel cover and airflow layers designed to maintain a perfectly cool sleep environment.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

